# ─── Gemini Computer Use (opt-in) ─────────────────────────────────
# Set ENABLE_COMPUTER_USE=1 to activate the Computer Use fallback for
# floor-plan navigation and the standalone product verifier. Requires
# Browserbase credentials below. Leave unset to keep the feature dormant.
